'''Heavenly God Super Zeus''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. He is an anti-[[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] and [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Thunder God Zeus (Uber Rare Cat)|Thunder God Zeus]] that was added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 762
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Heavenly God Super Zeus
|name2 = Giga Almighty God Super Zeus
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Giga Almighty God Super Zeus''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Super Zeus is a strange unit; he has a ton of HP but a rather miserable DPS for his super long recharge time. He can still find some use, though, as his DPS is greater than [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and his [[Slow]] ability makes [[Aku Gory]] much less of a threat. Due to the limited selection of anti-Aku, you'll likely want to use him against Aku, but there are better anti-Angel options out there. [[Surge Attack#Counter-Surge|Counter-Surge]] is not likely to be an ability to trigger often, due to Super Zeus being a backliner.

{{Job|Classification = Backliner & Crowd-Controller}}

